        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch: - \n\n\nEntrance Hall: - \nwith part panelled walls and storage cupboard\n\nLiving Room: - \nwith attractive fireplace with coal effect gas fire, ceiling coving and centre rose. Built in display cabinet. Door to\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room: - \nwith built in wall and floor presses, plumbed for washing machine and storage press.\n\nDining Room: - \nLaminate flooring. Storage press. Doors leading to back garden.\n\nUpstairs: - \n\n\nBedroom 1: - \nLarge Double Bedroom to the front of the property. Large window. Laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble Bedroom to the rear of the property. Laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom: - \nW.C, W.H.B. Frosted window overlooking the rear. Fully tiled floors and walls. Walk in shower.\n\nAttic - \nFully carpet flooring. Velux window. Versatile space.\n\n"
